    "title": "Maury County residents recovering after EF1 tornado touches down - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sara Smith ,\n1 days ago MAURY COUNTY, Tenn. (WKRN) — News 2 is getting a clearer picture of the damage from Sunday night’s storm in Maury County. Strong winds ripped through Columbia, bringing down trees and damaging homes. The National Weather Service has now confirmed an EF1 tornado touched down in Maury County. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
